# Purpose
Helps users set up recurring reviews with a clear rhythm, purpose, prepared
review list, and consistent review method.

# Key Sections
- When to use this guide.
- Choose a review rhythm.
- Start with the purpose.
- Prepare the review list.
- Review each item the same way.

# Dependencies
- Belongs to the productivity manual set.

# Gotchas
- Recurring reviews should remain tied to a useful decision or action, not just
  a calendar habit.

# Change History
- 2026-08-03: Added ACE companion.
